    <briefdescription>
<para>Public interface to the address sanitizer module pass for instrumenting code to check for various memory errors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This adds &apos;asan.module_ctor&apos; to &apos;llvm.global_ctors&apos;. This pass may also run intependently of the function address sanitizer. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
